@startuml UC11_MatchHistory_UseCase
title UC11 - View Match History (Use Case Diagram)
note "**Under Development**\nOnly Player.PvPWins / PvPLosses\ncounters exist. Detailed per-match\nrecording is not yet implemented." as N1
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Match History System" {
  (View PvP stats)
  (Read Player.PvPWins)
  (Read Player.PvPLosses)
  (Display basic win/loss)
}

Player --> (View PvP stats)
(View PvP stats) --> (Read Player.PvPWins) : <<include>>
(View PvP stats) --> (Read Player.PvPLosses) : <<include>>
(Read Player.PvPWins) --> (Display basic win/loss)
(Read Player.PvPLosses) --> (Display basic win/loss)
(Display basic win/loss) --> Player

note right of (Display basic win/loss)
  Planned features:
  - Detailed match history
  - Turn-by-turn replay
  - ELO tracking
  - Opponent info
end note

@enduml
